     "intro": "[Story]<br />\n\"Sodom\" was a famous city of success. But at the same time, drugs, violence, and <br />\ncrime were rampant in this city.<br />\nPhyulla was the young president of a security company who had come into the city,<br />\nboth for business reasons and to give her lover Murasaki a  \"certain something\".<br />\n<br />\n[Business Strategy RTS]<br />\nYou play as the girl/CEO Phyulla who runs a security company,<br />\nrecruits employees, and completes jobs.<br />\nBy completing jobs and earning money, you can get more business across the city<br />\nand get the item to give to your lover.<br />\n<br />\n[Promised Happy Ending]<br />\nThis is a yuri game, but the heroine Murasaki is an ex-prostitute so she is not a virgin.<br />\nLosing in this game leads to a violation scene.<br />\nHowever, the main route leads to the protagonists having a happy ending.<br />\n<br />\n22 base HCG, 70 incl. variations<br />\nApprox. 1 hour playtime<br />\n<br />\n[Precaution]<br />\nThis game requires DirectX 9.0c.<br />\n<a href=\"http://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/details.aspx?id=8109\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/details.aspx?id=8109</a><br />\n* Please confirm system compatibility via the trial version before purchasing.<br />\n* Recommend purchase with DLsite account for updates."
    }
   ]
